  </span><span class="p">],</span><span class="w">
  </span><span class="nl">"summary"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nl">"en"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">[</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"Book 1, written be Anne Author, published in Paris around 1400."</span><span class="w"> </span><